    <string name="about_licenses_intro">Torikomi is built with these open-source components:</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Torikomi does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data to its developers. There are no analytics or third-party trackers.\n\n• Download history (titles, links, thumbnails, file names) is stored only locally on your device and can be cleared anytime from the History tab.\n\n• The app uses the network only to: (a) fetch the media you choose to download from the links you provide (via yt-dlp), (b) check for app updates from GitHub, and (c) download/update the yt-dlp engine from GitHub.\n\n• Permissions used: storage (to save your downloads) and notifications (to show download and update status) — only for those purposes.\n\n• Downloaded content is subject to the copyright and terms of its original source; you are responsible for how you use it.\n\n• Torikomi is open source — see Open Source Licenses for the components used.</string>
